{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17120","headline":"余瑞麦 · 张聿","name":"余瑞麦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑞麦生尧日，芃芃雨露偏。\n两岐分更合，异亩頴仍连。\n冀获明王庆，宁唯太守贤。\n仁风吹靡靡，甘雨长芊芊。\n圣德应多稔，皇家配有年。\n已闻天下泰，谁爲济西田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张聿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}